      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Derelict Residence on C. 0.6 Statute Acre.\n\nThe property comprises a derelict residential dwelling requiring complete refurbishment.\n\nSituated in a convenient location adjacent to Charleville Golf Club and approximately 2.5 kilometres from Charleville Town centre where all major amenities and transport links can be found.\n\nThe residence occupies a generous, rectangular-shaped site extending to approximately 0.6 statute acre, with mature hedgerow boundaries providing a good degree of privacy and enclosure.\n\nThe property has been vacant for a number of years and may potentially qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the applicable eligibility criteria, terms and conditions.\n\nOverall, the property presents an excellent redevelopment opportunity in a highly convenient location, with significant potential for refurbishment, extension or replacement, subject to the necessary planning permissions and statutory approvals. (Note: The property is not being sold subject to planning permission).\n\nContact GVM Auctioneers on 063 98555\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
